\fs28 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 James Lewis 0 minutes 3 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 Just a kind of an overview of just Cevo, who we are as a business, not that it's necessarily that relevant for kind of us as a customer to you guys in the sort of project that we're working on. I know Janita has shared with you some of the high-level kind of overview around some of the...\cb1 \
\
\cb3 James Lewis 0 minutes 24 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 the health data records and looking at that through the lens of, you know, how can the Databricks platform get some insights and sort of, you know, pulling all of that data together and so forth. Just sort of in parallel, and I'll get into it in a minute, but we work obviously closely with AWS as a primary.\cb1 \
\
\cb3 James Lewis 0 minutes 44 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 sort of partner and we do a lot of work in that platform. Databricks is our other main partner that we do a lot of work with as well. So some of the work that we've been doing with the AWS Healthcare team is very kind of relevant to the use cases that Janita had put forward. So just wanted to, and I'm not sure that we've got it completely ready, but\cb1 \
\
\cb3 James Lewis 1 minute 6 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 bring some of those two things together so that when you guys are producing the work as part of this project, it's something that we can all use, that Janita and ourselves can use when we're going to talk to real healthcare providers and hospitals and, you know, research departments at universities and so on and so forth. So really we want you guys to produce something that will\cb1 \
\
\cb3 James Lewis 1 minute 29 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 help ultimately help us to go and accelerate our conversations that we have in the real world around these types of things as well. On that note, just a bit about me. So I don't have a slide on me particularly. So I'm James Lewis. So I'm one of the business leaders and principals that\cb1 \
\
\cb3 James Lewis 1 minute 49 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 Civo. So we're a born in the cloud AWS and Databricks partner. So we're a consulting partner. So we help organisations to transform and modernise their applications and systems and so forth on the AWS and the Databricks platform.\cb1 \
\
\cb3 James Lewis 2 minutes 8 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 So again, what we're trying to do is we don't want to just come in and be transactional and go and deliver a piece of work and step out. Our name, Civo, is Continuous Evolution. So we really want to help customers, you know, throughout their life cycle of, you know, their modernization journeys to the cloud. So\cb1 \
\
\cb3 James Lewis 2 minutes 28 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 We want them to continue to build and evolve and transform, irrespective of whether they're right at the beginning and they haven't done anything in the cloud or on Databricks before, or whether they're a really mature customer and they're looking at the next phase of innovation and evolution. But I'll just pause there. Midhun, I can see you've got your hand up.\cb1 \
